From cbe36037cde6a687d4fa2b186745c610b3a53392 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 16:42:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Show a launch screen instead of a blank screen while the
 server wakes

The home-screen app sat on a black screen until a sleeping server
answered. The service worker now shows a cached branded launch screen
if the server hasn't responded within 0.6s, and swaps to the real page
as soon as it does. Adds iPhone launch images, caching for static build
files, and /api/health?warm=1 so keep-alive pings also warm MongoDB.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018dkMKEURPzJi3SFfURBADs
